WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.920
Hello, brother.

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:22.898
I can't do this, Stefan.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.234
Incendia!

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:26.944
No!

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.779
Stefan, I love you.

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:31.490
Something's wrong.

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:32.950
-With Elena?
-With me.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:36.995
Kiss me.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.710
Damon is not stable
right now.

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:44.962
You know he murdered
my wife?

00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:49.925
All right, let's go.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:50.968
Clothes on.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:53.262
Jeremy wrote this?

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:55.848
I'm not playing anymore.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:59.977
I said get out!

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:01.979
Hello, Elena.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.651
Hell, I can take down
a vampire.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.986
That spell is easy to learn.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:17.536
I know that I'm…
I'm falling in love.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.454
Stefan didn't drink
the papal blood.

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:20.998
If you were curious.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.502
The moon stone, Stefan.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.004
Tick tock.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.381
Just a taste.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:32.259
No, no! No, Mumma!

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:35.596
I don't want you
to be alone.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.642
-Katerina.
-No.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:43.020
You may be my father,

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.022
but I am never going to be
your daughter, you got that?

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:48.025
Stefan Salvatore, I hereby
invite you into this home.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.234
Damon, I'll do better,
I promise.

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.152
No.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.616
You know where the witches
were burned?

00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:56.783
Did I forget
to mention that?

00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:58.577
You're going to have to hit
me a lot harder than that.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.496
He is human.

00:02:02.039 --> 00:02:03.040
A life means nothing.

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.082
Damon, no!

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.045
For me, it’s the end.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:10.797
Take it.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.467
It's his signature.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.052
There's a reason
they call him the Ripper.

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.137
A fatal werewolf bite.

00:02:17.221 --> 00:02:18.055
Ouch.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:19.223
Forget Stefan.

00:02:19.306 --> 00:02:21.058
I'm so much more fun.

00:02:24.478 --> 00:02:25.812
You are supposed to be dead.

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:28.148
Take it easy.

00:02:28.232 --> 00:02:29.650
We both know you're
kind of a lightweight.

00:02:31.193 --> 00:02:33.070
OK, please tell me that's
a recipe for witch cookies.

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:39.076
Just keep the claws in
tonight at the dance, OK?

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:43.455
I just fed her my blood.

00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:45.082
No more hybrids
if she's a vampire.

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.667
You're better
than both of us.

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.211
I love her, Damon.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.088
So do I.

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:57.094
The pentagram represents
our connection to magic.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:58.720
Have a drink with me,
brother.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.140
Please say
that you forgive me.

00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:05.310
I never stopped loving you.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:12.109
Our emotions
are what make us human.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:19.533
Am I dead?

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.202
You did it.

00:03:23.078 --> 00:03:24.121
I know it's hard.

00:03:25.414 --> 00:03:26.582
See you in Gym.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.295
You don't have to hide it.

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:33.130
I know you're not
going to hurt me.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.381
You lost her?

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:36.133
Lost is a very strong word.

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:38.844
All I can think about
is killing vampires.

00:03:43.515 --> 00:03:45.142
Saved by the cellphone.

00:03:46.101 --> 00:03:47.436
Where is the cure?

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:49.313
I'm not crazy.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:50.814
I'm just passionate.

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:52.232
Left or right?

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:54.151
I'll just chop off both
to be safe.

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:56.236
I would give anything
to be human.

00:03:57.738 --> 00:03:58.864
We have to raise Silas.

00:04:00.908 --> 00:04:02.784
It can bring Jeremy back.

00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:04.703
People are going to start
asking questions.

00:04:04.786 --> 00:04:06.163
I don't care.

00:04:06.246 --> 00:04:07.289
It won't be fun,

00:04:08.165 --> 00:04:09.166
but we're going to
cleanse you.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:11.126
She's this close to going
off the rails for good

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.169
and that ain't happening.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:14.129
I had to shovel my best
friend almost killed me.

00:04:14.213 --> 00:04:15.172
None of this is OK!

00:04:15.756 --> 00:04:17.257
I am immortal.

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:25.516
I got the girl.

00:04:27.768 --> 00:04:28.936
I love you.

00:04:29.019 --> 00:04:30.187
And I love you.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.355
Where the hell am I?

00:04:31.939 --> 00:04:33.190
The Other Side.

00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.734
You've been dreaming
about Stefan all summer?

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:38.278
This is the…
the family crypt, huh?

00:04:38.362 --> 00:04:39.196
Mm-hmm.

00:04:39.279 --> 00:04:40.906
Damon, please.
I don't want to die.

00:04:43.951 --> 00:04:45.202
I'm dead, Jer.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:46.787
I need to know
that you're going to be OK.

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:50.332
I told you I knew
what I was doing.

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:55.337
It was the 1950s.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.214
Am I supposed to remember
every moment of my life?

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:59.091
This is the worst day
of my life.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:03.220
And I kind of totally
had sex with him.

00:05:03.846 --> 00:05:05.347
I'm here
to kidnap your boyfriend.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:10.686
If I can't have Stefan,

00:05:11.895 --> 00:05:12.729
then no one can.

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:14.022
We've a lot of catching up
to do.

00:05:15.816 --> 00:05:16.942
See you in class.

00:05:18.819 --> 00:05:19.987
I need your help.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.446
I think something's going on
on the other side.

00:05:23.907 --> 00:05:24.741
Ouch.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.744
Let's play a game called
Never Have I Ever.

00:05:28.662 --> 00:05:30.706
Somebody help!

00:05:33.792 --> 00:05:35.794
This is the last time
I'm going to see you.

00:05:36.795 --> 00:05:38.046
What happened?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.256
Where is everybody?

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:43.886
Will you marry me?

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:47.848
Oh my God!

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:50.350
Why didn't Bonnie
come back?

00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:52.728
How do you feel?

00:05:52.811 --> 00:05:54.688
Like you shot me
with an arrow.

00:05:55.397 --> 00:05:56.940
My dad's trying to kill me.

00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:58.734
It was a video journal.

00:05:58.817 --> 00:06:00.694
What? No.
Journals are lame.

00:06:04.239 --> 00:06:06.074
I've never felt more alive.

00:06:06.742 --> 00:06:08.452
-We're losing her, Damon!
-No offence Elena

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:09.661
but we need to get
a real doctor.

00:06:09.745 --> 00:06:11.914
-Kill her!
-Mortis!

00:06:12.748 --> 00:06:14.208
Our lives are so weird.

00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:15.667
That's the understatement
of the century.

00:06:16.251 --> 00:06:18.670
I'm going to me all right,
Mum. I promise.

00:06:19.171 --> 00:06:20.088
Hey, Elena, what...

00:06:21.757 --> 00:06:23.258
She has
a really pretty neck.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.220
You can't breathe.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:30.682
I want to die.

00:06:30.766 --> 00:06:31.600
What if the human you

00:06:31.683 --> 00:06:32.893
doesn't love Damon
anymore?

00:06:38.023 --> 00:06:39.149
Are you ready for this?

00:06:39.775 --> 00:06:41.193
Elena told me
to keep a journal

00:06:41.276 --> 00:06:42.152
of everything she's missing.

00:06:42.236 --> 00:06:44.196
What do you think
about letting me use magic

00:06:44.279 --> 00:06:45.155
to stop your heart?

00:06:45.239 --> 00:06:46.782
This is necromancy.

00:06:49.034 --> 00:06:51.161
Well, what better way
to spend Halloween, huh?

00:06:51.245 --> 00:06:52.496
Quit torturing my brother

00:06:52.579 --> 00:06:53.997
and tell me exactly
what's going on here.

00:06:54.081 --> 00:06:55.624
He's unrecognisable.

00:06:55.707 --> 00:06:57.167
Lily needs to go.

00:06:57.251 --> 00:06:59.002
Incoming.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.173
No! Lily!

00:07:03.257 --> 00:07:04.383
I'm level-headed, Damon.

00:07:04.466 --> 00:07:06.802
I only come out when Stefan
goes a little cuckoo.

00:07:06.885 --> 00:07:07.886
While you were
working on me

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.179
Julian stole Stefan's body.

00:07:09.263 --> 00:07:12.182
I am not raising my kids
anywhere near Mystic Falls.

00:07:12.266 --> 00:07:13.684
If you hate Julian so much

00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:15.185
can't you just go
kill him yourself?

00:07:19.231 --> 00:07:21.191
No. That's not it.

00:07:21.275 --> 00:07:22.943
No, because every time
Rayna dies,

00:07:23.026 --> 00:07:24.194
she comes back stronger.

00:07:25.404 --> 00:07:26.655
Make your choice.

00:07:27.281 --> 00:07:28.407
I love you, brother.

00:07:29.199 --> 00:07:30.200
Cut the crap, buddy.

00:07:30.284 --> 00:07:32.202
No, I won't let you die,
Bonnie Bennett.

00:07:33.787 --> 00:07:35.163
I'm trying to save
someone who hates me.

00:07:35.247 --> 00:07:36.206
Which one?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.583
No one's getting out.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.209
Bonnie, please!

00:07:39.293 --> 00:07:42.212
Did you raid a Cosplay
convention or something?

00:07:42.963 --> 00:07:43.922
Damon.

00:07:44.006 --> 00:07:45.215
Elena.

00:07:46.133 --> 00:07:48.218
How many more bodies will
it take before this is over?

00:07:48.302 --> 00:07:49.761
I think it was made in Hell.

00:07:51.305 --> 00:07:52.806
I choose Enzo!

00:07:55.017 --> 00:07:57.060
I'm trying to help
my brother.

00:07:57.144 --> 00:07:58.520
Tyler Lockwood is dead.

00:07:59.313 --> 00:08:00.439
And I'm not going to
lose you too.

00:08:00.522 --> 00:08:03.442
I've got to say, you're
a man with a lot of guts.

00:08:04.234 --> 00:08:05.861
I didn't have time
to poison it.

00:08:09.531 --> 00:08:10.407
We can't seem
to go anywhere

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:12.451
without the past
coming back to haunt us.

00:08:12.534 --> 00:08:13.660
I guess the inside
of Damon's head

00:08:13.744 --> 00:08:15.454
looks a whole lot
like the outside.

00:08:15.537 --> 00:08:17.039
You said you weren't going
to try anything stupid.

00:08:17.122 --> 00:08:18.415
When did I ever
promise that?

00:08:19.041 --> 00:08:20.667
-Enzo!
-Bonnie!

00:08:21.502 --> 00:08:22.461
We're starting to slip back

00:08:22.544 --> 00:08:24.421
into
H-E Double Hockey Sticks.

00:08:24.505 --> 00:08:26.507
We don't know
what he'll do to Elena.

00:08:30.511 --> 00:08:31.386
Damon.

00:08:32.387 --> 00:08:33.430
Hello, brother.

